  "has_voiceover": false,
  "description": "More news, more opinions, more stress. Do a little less... see a lot more result.",
  "body_html": "<p>Somedays, I watch people relentlessly reading the news… trying to find the answer to the stock market’s next move. Scrolling reddit for some keen insight. Stressed out because they saw an influencer talk bad about one of their stock (including me). And what does all of this “research” do for your portfolio? Often times…nothing, if not damage it. </p><p>This behavior will just stress you out. Over analyze and over speculate, resulting in bad decision making. Shaking you out of positions, that would have been great later on, had you NOT received that unnecessary “update.”</p><p>If I have an update for you, I will update you. My focus is more on <strong>quality</strong> posts that have tangible, positive, impacts <em><strong>when the updates are necessary.</strong></em> </p><p>I’ve had 24 videos with over a million views… been there, done that. I don’t really care about getting tons of videos out or chasing clicks. The stock market has not really needed much “updating” lately. </p><ul><li><p>The S&amp;P 500 is continuing to consolidate in a bullish structure. </p></li><li><p>Silver has put in a higher high, and no lower low since our July update. </p></li><li><p>All of our own individual stocks were updated about a week ago. Many of them continue to consolidate. Small consolidation pullbacks, do not warrant panic.</p><ul><li><p>→ <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/i-reviewed-every-stock-we-own-heres?r=4z8lgl\">See Current Stock Positions and Status here</a></strong></p></li></ul></li></ul><p>Sometimes the market is simply going to be boring. Don’t run away… but a quick check-in will suffice as we chop around. As a breakout investor, you will most often see surges in content from me when 1 of the 3 is happening:</p><ol><li><p>The market, or individual stocks, are tapping 52 period highs. </p></li><li><p>The market, or individual stocks, are tapping 52 period lows. </p></li><li><p>During consolidations, you will see me build “buy” lists (or short lists, pending market conditions). We did this most recently with all of the Midweek Mover’s winners. Those are listed in the <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/the-stocktok-summary?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok Summary (Click here)</a>. </strong></p></li></ol><p>If you are ever wondering: “What was the last thing Timothy said about (insert ticker/topic)?” You can always search my Substack very easily, just watch the 10 second clip below:</p><div class=\"native-video-embed\" data-component-name=\"VideoPlaceholder\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;mediaUploadId&quot;:&quot;60f39a7d-322e-4f0d-8487-3a4857fcd758&quot;,&quot;duration&quot;:null}\"></div><p>You may also swing into the main chat, during market hours, if you have particular questions. </p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p><em><strong>Relax, enjoy these periods of chop</strong></em>. They provide opportunities to refresh your mind, build new buy lists and time to do another activity of your desire. My daughters have gotten into Pokemon cards, and yesterday I decided to wrestle with the scalpers at Best Buy for 30th Anniversary Pokemon cards (lol, I know, ridiculous). </p><p>My speculation is the market will have another leg upwards, including our own assets. </p><p>If there is an update that is needed, I will let you know  :)</p><p>Have a great day, and thanks for stopping by! </p><h4>Please do like ❤️ and re-stack 🔄 this post, to combat the AI slop.</h4><div class=\"community-chat\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://open.substack.com/pub/tjstocks/chat?utm_source=chat_embed&quot;,&quot;subdomain&quot;:&quot;tjstocks&quot;,&quot;pub&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:3537822,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Timothy’s StockTok&quot;,&quot;author_name&quot;:&quot;StockTok 📈&quot;,&quot;author_photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!W3S9!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8add7fc9-8edc-4748-ba33-360428e75ee1_1206x1206.png&quot;}}\" data-component-name=\"CommunityChatRenderPlaceholder\"></div>",
  "has_dynamic_content": false,
